/www.servicenow.com/docs/r/platform-administration/t\\_AddingTheConditionCountWidget.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"task","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":1,"breadcrumb":["Condition field types","Reference","Field administration","Forms","fields","and lists","Configure core features","Administer the ServiceNow AI Platform"],"tags":["#platform-administration","#type-task"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/platform-administration/t_AddingTheConditionCountWidget.md"},
